  },
  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/e/csm_josua_schade_9179cf0129.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">At ZOLLER, we tailor our hardware and software to the application’s needs. This allows us to offer practical solutions from a single source.</p> <p><strong>Josua Schade, TMS Hardware Product Management</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/b/csm_sarah-michelle_wiacek_c4c06a6999.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">The ZOLLER assembly team in Pleidelsheim, Germany, gives it their all every day to ensure the consistently high quality of your ZOLLER Smart Cabinets. It’s simple to be part of it!</p> <p><strong>Sarah-Michelle Wiacek, Work Planning Team</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/9/csm_michael_haas_a5847acaff.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">With the ZOLLER Smart Cabinets, our customers avoid errors in the ongoing manufacturing process while also increasing efficiency.</p> <p><strong>Michael Haas, Sales, ZOLLER South</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    }
   ],
